      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "bitmap_page_lookup.lance\n\nnew       → {r0, r3, r8, r11}\nrunning   → {r1, r4, r5}\nfailed    → {r2, r9}\nNULL      → {r6, r7, r10}\n\nOne file row per value\nBitmaps are loaded lazily and cached",
