      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Equals\nstatus = 'failed'\nload 1 posting · M = 1\n\nIN\n('new', 'failed')\nload 2 · union · M = 2\n\nExact\n{r0,r2,r3,r8,r9,r11}",
      "rawText": "Equals\nstatus = 'failed'\nload 1 posting · M = 1\n\nIN\n('new', 'failed')\nload 2 · union · M = 2\n\nExact\n{r0,r2,r3,r8,r9,r11}",
